flowchart TD
  P2[P2 PIT context] --> S1[S1-S3 Intake, PIT, N+1 feedback]
  S1 --> POP[S4-S8 Population and initial graph]
  POP --> W[S9-S11 Warm-up canonical replay]
  W --> K[S12-S16 RAG, GraphRAG, memory/tool policies]
  K --> EVT[S17-S19 Stimuli and deterministic activation]
  EVT --> RET[S20 Post-activation retrieval and context]
  RET --> COG[S21 LLM planning -> MCP execution -> LLM continuation]
  COG --> BEL[S22-S23 Belief validation and person state]
  BEL --> SOC[S24-S26 Social, trust, memory, checkpoint]
  SOC --> EM[S27-S29 Emergence, tags, evidence]
  EM --> P4[S30 P4 official handoff]
  EM --> P9E[S31 P9 evidence export]
  P9E --> P9[P9 external evaluation, statistics, Retro and promotion]
  P9 -. promoted patch and matured feedback N+1 .-> S1
  SOC -. state and endogenous queue N+1 .-> EVT
